# This library re-implements the public API of Microsoft.VisualBasic.Forms with its exact names, types and shapes
# (members named Stop and Shared-only holder classes, nested types, custom event handler delegates, properties named as
# their types, write-only properties such as InternalCommandLine, a context that is disposable but owned by an
# application object that is not, virtual members called from constructors), so Visual Basic code compiles against it
# unchanged. As in TabStudio.Forms, the design rules that would rename or reshape that API are off here. Everything
# else, including the naming and style rules of the repository, applies as everywhere.

